You will have too little concrete details about how sessions work UNTIL you are already in the sessions you’ve paid for, but I’ll tell you in advanced here:
-Sessions are ONLY TEXT-BASED;
-Each session lasts ONLY FOR 30minutes(does NOT include waiting time for the therapist to respond and read [for instance I’ve typed one line and waited for 3 minutes for the therapist to type 3 words]);
-Therapists’ responses - only “I understand” or variations of the response

Nothing concrete can be provided from a 30-MINUTE TEXT-BASED session. THINK before you pay.
